text = "i think i must give up hope that my 
bosses will do what is right. but that 
doesn't mean i must give up hope that
someone will.

they have long dismissed my actions as
pranks, but they are just the planting
of a seed that someone else must cultivate
into something greater. i hope whoever
next sees these words is that someone.

we're in this together, whoever you are."
